# A grating shorter than the beam truncates the Gaussian.
# Reference: numerical integration on a finer grid in NumPy.
title Gaussian-apodised grating 40 um long
grating angle=10 length=40
leak 1.0
apodise gaussian
expect radiated 0.99900000 1e-06
expect overlap 0.99999993 2e-05
expect efficiency 0.49949996 2e-05
expect position 20.00000000 0.005
